  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4e61a74a-2d10-4cae-9321-9431cd9837ab.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"419\" height=\"102\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4d77709c-a999-4305-8562-4fb18848b860.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"284\" height=\"102\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c2a43084-6b41-40bf-8d47-4b3f23afe553.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_86e4dd84-30c8-41e1-923b-338c23ded807.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"556\" height=\"102\"></p>\n<p>這是一個簡單的資源包，用於將村民的舊版紋理替換為全新增強的《Create》創作版紋理。</p>\n<p>此紋理包也應用於熱門整合包 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/create-lets-create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: let's Create</a> 中。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6fe5aa9d-d11a-4b3f-855a-8f3666dd0ec4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">感謝我們的贊助商</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">感謝 ZAP-HOSTING！使用優惠碼 Reggarf-1047 即可享受全店訂單 8 折優惠！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fzap-hosting.com%252fcreateletscreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://zap-hosting.com/createletscreate</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fzap-hosting.com%252fcreateletscreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e5eb7bf5-5d56-4b83-8a4a-679d966ba9f3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"129\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
